# Default-deny: ignore everything in the agent dir, re-admit only the curated config.
# Runtime data (sessions, npm, git, fff, fabric, pi-web-*, tokens, auth) stays ignored.
*
!.gitignore
!AGENTS.md
!keybindings.json
!settings.json
!mcp.json
!models.json.tmpl
!extensions/
extensions/*
!extensions/*.ts
!prompts/
!themes/
